# Assistant content: markdown headings render bold (internal/tui/
# markdown.go's Heading style: Bold + a trailing blank line).
@faux testdata/faux/qa/content-headings.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT welcome
TYPE explain the change
KEY enter
WAITFOR /Middleware/ 20
SHOT reply
EXPECT /Overview/
EXPECT /Middleware/
EXPECT /Rate limiting happens here/
EXPECT_NOT /# Overview/
EXPECT_NOT /## Middleware/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
